{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milk Store is a psychological horror game about building, managing, and trying to hold together your very own milk store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve always dreamed of running your own store, haven\u2019t you? A quiet job. A simple life. Just you, the customers, and the milk. Nothing to worry about.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate and manage a perfectly normal milk store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the helpful tutorial. Do not deviate from it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based items, pick them up, throw them, use them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the store to your liking. Stack shelves. Talk to customers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix Fix Fix Fix Fix Fix Fix Fix Fix Fix [ERROR] OVERFLOW ERROR DETECTED IN FILE storepage.txt in line 1224::23</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know friendly customers. From old to young everyone likes milk and with enough time they might even start to like you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548570?t=1760373888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548570?t=1760373888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548570/d103cee1fceb87b6962d37025134ee44d958e2b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760373888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548570/d103cee1fceb87b6962d37025134ee44d958e2b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760373888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes